/**
 * Web Development Foundations — the whole course, written out.
 *
 * Every lesson here follows the same shape a textbook chapter uses: a formal
 * definition, the reasoning that makes the definition make sense, the
 * mechanics in detail, a worked example traced step by step, the mistakes
 * learners reliably make, a reference table, a summary and an exercise set.
 * Reading time is derived from the word count by `lesson()`, so nobody has to
 * keep a duration field honest by hand.
 */

